        "1.18-2.0.32":"- Updated to Minecraft 1.18\r\n- Updated Forge to version 38.0.5\r\n- Updated CC: Tweaked to version 1.99.0\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 1.18-2.1.8"
    },
