    },
    "1.18.2":{
        "1.18.1-2.0.40":"- API: Tags-related methods signatures were modified due to the changes to the MC Tags system. This is a breaking change. Since I was already breaking stuff I cleaned up the API a bit too.\r\nPorted to Minecraft 1.18.2\r\nUpdated Forge version to 40.0.12\r\nUpdated CC:Tweaked version to 1.100.3\r\nUpdated Patchouli version to 1.18.2-66"
        ,
        "1.18.1-2.0.41":"- Book: Added missing entry for the Fuel Injection Port and tweaked some pages a bit\r\nFIX: Return an empty FuelData when a FuelRod is not yet linked to a ControlRod. Closes #78. Thanks to DMSledge for the report.\r\nBumped version to 2.0.41\r\n"
        ,
        "1.18.1-2.0.42":"- Fix multiblock assembly in corer cases before opt2 is merged in\r\n- Added back support for Mekanism in 1.18.2\r\n- Updated Forge to version 40.1.0\r\n- Updated Mekanism to version 10.2.0.459\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.100.4\r\n- Updated JEI to version 9.7.0.100\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.16\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.42\r\n"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.44":"- Added Enderium Block from FTB Industrial Contraptions to the forge:storage_blocks/enderium so it can be used as a moderator\r\n- Typo. Close #82\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 1.18.2-2.1.17 to fix a crash when an error is displayed on the screen\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.44"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.45":"- Added three new Moderators for your Reactors as a nod to the past!\r\n- The Fluidizer recipes now accepts non-reactants ingredients\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.45"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.49":"- Added a button in the Reprocessor Controller GUI to void all fluids in the internal tank\r\n- Fixed a couple of errors in da book. Close #90, thanks to aharrisw for the report\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.49"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.51":"- API: names of named objects should respect the rules for ResourceLocations\r\n- API: added colour information to coolants and vapors\r\n- Added to the JEI plugin : reactants reactions, reactants solid/fluid mappings, coolants <=> vapors transitions, coolants and vapors mappings\r\n- Fixed icons in the Fluidizer JEI recipe category\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to 2.1.22\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.51"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.55":"- Fix error messages not being displayed on the correct client in lan games\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.55"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.60":"- JEI compat: linked various recipe categories (reactants, vapors, mappings, etc) to a figurehead block (controller, access port, etc) to simplify access to them\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.30\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.60"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.61":"- Fixed some recipes not showing up in JEI\r\n- Updated JEI to version 10.2.1.1002\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.31\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.61"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.63":"- Fix Fuel Rods models not being rotated correctly for horizontal fuel assemblies. Thanks to Ssserpent for the report.\r\n- Fix Fuel Rods graphics updates on fuel levels changes.\r\n- Reworked how Fuel Rods are tracked to speed up their updates\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.34\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.63"
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.70":"- Completed move to wide energy storage\r\n- Prevent possibile energy transfer bug with certains mods and Passive Power Taps\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.39\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.70"		
        ,
        "1.18.2-2.0.71":"- Added new end-game Turbine coil : Insanite\r\n- Rebalanced eng-game Turbine coils\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.71"
    },
