		,
		"1.20.1-2.0.69":"- Reprocessor : disable the rendering of the morphing animation if rubidium (a sodium fork) is installed to avoid an invalid cast crash on their side.\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.69"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.70":"- Completed move to wide energy storage\r\n- Prevent possibile energy transfer bug with certains mods and Passive Power Taps\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.39\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.70"		
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.71":"- Added new end-game Turbine coil : Insanite\r\n- Rebalanced eng-game Turbine coils\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.71"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.72":"- Fixed incorrect drop from the Benitoite Ore. Closes #121\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.72"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.73":"- Re-enabled Mekanism compat\r\n- Updated Mekanism to version 1.20.1-10.4.0.14\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.73"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.74":"- Added missing fluid tag for Yellorium. Closes #127\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.74"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.75":"- Fixed in-game book recipe\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.75"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.76":"- Allow mods to add their own Reactor parts\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.76"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.77":"- Allow mods to add their own Turbine parts\r\n- Allow mods to add their own Reprocessors and Fluidizer parts\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.41\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.77"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.78":"- Fix fluids and reactants buckets not rendering the fluid colour\r\nUpdated ZeroCore to version 1.20.1-2.1.42\r\nBumped version to 2.0.78"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.79":"- Added the Energizer energy storage: a (max) 32x32x32 multiblock that can store up to 18.45 EFE. Build the frame with casing blocks, fill the interior with Energy Cells and place Controllers, Power Ports and Charging Ports on any face as you please (the in-game book pages are being written).\r\n- Added Raw Yellorium (item & block) and Deepslate Yellorite Ore block. Both Yellorite ores now drops Raw Yellorium\r\n- The Fluidizer now render the fluid in its internal tank\r\n- Fix Fluidizer recipe progress being resetted when the ingredients changes. Close #140\r\n- Fix Reprocessor recipe progress being reported when ingredients are not valid\r\n- Added moderators sub-command to /er\r\n- Reworked internal code for common machines/containers/screens\r\n- New layout for the Turbine Controller screen\r\n- Tweaked the alignment of controls in the screens of charging ports and the Reactor Solid Access port\r\n- Tweaked the screens of the Reactor\r\n- Tweaked the screens of the Fluidizer\r\n- Tweaked the screens of the Reprocessor\r\n- Added a show recipes button to the Reactor, Fluidizer and Reprocessor Controller screen\r\n- Updated translations and added it_it and ru_ru\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.43\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.79"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.80":"- Fix crash in Extreme Reactors Create Compat\r\n- Better support for the block models from Extreme Reactors Create Compat\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.44\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.80"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.81":"- Fix activation state not being saved for generators-multiblocks\r\n- Fixed client-only config option disableApiTooltips not showing up in the client config file. Closes #153\r\n- Changed the default value for the maxEnergizerHeight and maxEnergizerSize config options to the max allowed value\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.81"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.82":"- Added list sub-command to /er reactants | reaction | moderators | coils\r\n- Lifted limits on energy generation by popular demands\r\n- Mod packs API wrapper: allow empty arrays\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.82"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.83":"- Added the Energizer Computer Port\r\n- Added new/old moderators from Draconic-Evolution, allthemodium, Thermal Extra\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.83"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.84":"- Fixed fluid buckets not working properly. Closes #160\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.45\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.84"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.85":"- Fix loading of er_gui_theme.json. Closes #172\r\n- Book: added a section for the Energizer and a new introductory text\r\n- Book: refined the old pages a bit\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.46\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.85"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.86":"- Fix particles on rotor shaft and blade blocks. Closes #174\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.86"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.87":"- Added a model fallback to be used when (Neo)Forge cannot supply the correct ModelData during quad or particle requests (see https://github.com/neoforged/NeoForge/issues/1629)\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 1.20.1-2.1.47\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.87"
        ,
        "1.20.1-2.0.88":"- New low-poly Turbine Rotor model for better shader compatibility\r\nBumped version to 2.0.88"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.0.90":"- Added the Energizer Active FE Power Port block. In output mode, it supplies energy to any Forge Energy-compatible block. Closes #182\r\n- Tweaked energy distribution to exclude all passive and input ports\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.90"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.0.91":"- Changed the min/max values of the global/reactor/turbine power production multiplier to 0.005 / 100.0\r\n- Changed the max capacity of the reactor/turbine energy buffers to scale with the power production multipliers in the same way as energy production is.\r\n- Fixed energy buffer capacity not correctly reported in the Reactor Controller GUI\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.91"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.0.92":"- Fixed crash related to an empty FuelRodMap. Closes #196\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.92"		
		,
        "1.20.1-2.0.93":"- The Reactor computer method getControlRodLocation() now correctly return the Control Rod location as a map\r\n- Added some missing item tags for yellorite / deepslate yellorite\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.93"		
		,
        "1.20.1-2.0.94":"- Reactors, Turbines and Energizers now don't turn themself off when the multiblock is disassambled (by the player or by chunk unloading) keeping their last know state when a save is reloaded. Closes #205\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.94"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.0.95":"- Added simplified Chinese localization (by ZH)\r\n- Added Japanese localization (by twister716)\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.95"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.0.96":"- Raised max extraction rate for Reactors/Turbines Power Ports from 5 MFE/t to 50 MFE/t\r\n- Raised max charge rate for Reactors/Turbines Charging Ports from 5 KFE/t to 25 KFE/t\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.96"
		,
        "1.20.1-2.0.97":"- Stop multiblocks from keeping chunks loaded more then necessary\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.1.48\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.97"		
	},
